# Born-blocking no-new-reorg-target-debt gate (Global Binding Rule 1; bootstrap step T3b).
# Live-corpus half: Arms A-D over the real tree against the committed shrink-only baseline
# (zero NEW debt). Fixture half: specs/fixtures/reorg-target-debt/tc-*.json prove every
# refusal class, the proven-claim pass, and the fail-closed interval audit through the same
# engine the binary runs.
